sshpilot (5.7.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release v5.7.2.
  * Introducing Omnisearch—a powerful, versatile pop-up search box
    accessible from anywhere by double-pressing the Shift key
  * Added a minimal sidebar mode that uses a narrow, icon-only strip to
    free up horizontal screen space
  * Added an option to open the file manager in SSH terminal panes from
    the tab context menu
  * Added an option to open a terminal in file manager tabs
  * Improved the appearance and overall experience of the SFTP file
    manager
  * Fixed an issue that delayed application shutdown when local terminal
    tabs were open
  * Various bug fixes and UI improvements

